### =======================================
### NgiNep User Service - API Testing
### Gunakan file ini di IntelliJ (HTTP Client) 
### Klik tombol "Run" (hijau) di sebelah kiri tiap request
### =======================================

### 1. Register Akun Baru
# Setelah jalankan ini, cek email kamu untuk melihat kode OTP
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Budi",
  "last_name": "Santoso",
  "age": 25,
  "city_id": 1,
  "phone": "081234567890",
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### 2. Verify OTP
# Ganti "123456" dengan 6 digit OTP yang kamu terima di email
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "otp_code": "123456"
}

###

### 3. Resend OTP (Opsional jika OTP expired)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/resend-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com"
}

###

### 4. Login
# Jika berhasil, kamu akan mendapat respons berisi "token"
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### =======================================
### ENDPOINT PROTECTED (BUTUH JWT TOKEN)
### 
### COPY "token" dari respons Login di atas,
### lalu PASTE untuk menggantikan teks {{token}} di bawah ini
### =======================================

@token = paste_token_jwt_kamu_di_sini_tanpa_tanda_kutip

### 5. Lihat Profil (GET /api/users/me)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 6. Update Profil (PUT /api/users/me)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Budi",
  "last_name": "Setiawan",
  "phone": "08999999999",
  "age": 26
}

###

### 7. Ganti Password
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/users/me/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "old_password": "password123",
  "new_password": "newpassword123",
  "confirm_password": "newpassword123"
}
